# Ash Desktop: the default ArchISO GNOME desktop environment.
#
# Mirrors the desktop layer of the official Arch Linux GNOME ISO:
# the GNOME group (gnome-shell, GDM, GNOME Control Center, core GNOME
# apps), GVfs, PipeWire audio, and xorg-xhost for the MAD Installer
# launcher's Xwayland display grant. No XFCE, KDE/Plasma, or LightDM
# packages.
accountsservice
gdm
gnome
gvfs
pavucontrol
pipewire
pipewire-alsa
pipewire-pulse
ttf-dejavu
wireplumber
xdg-user-dirs
xdg-utils
xorg-xhost
